WEBVTT

00:01.790 --> 00:06.530
<i>There once was a powerless prince who 
saved a kingdom with his tiny courage.</i>

00:07.660 --> 00:10.110
<i>The courage to face challenges...</i>

00:10.110 --> 00:12.060
<i>The courage to never give up...</i>

00:12.470 --> 00:14.650
<i>The courage to trust others...</i>

00:15.500 --> 00:20.180
<i>A treasure chest of untold courage 
is now about to be opened.</i>

00:27.130 --> 00:33.550
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

00:27.130 --> 00:33.550
<b>— The Treasure Chest of Courage —</b>

00:36.500 --> 00:41.260
<i>The callous absurdity I've 
carried with me since birth</i>

00:41.260 --> 00:46.930
<i>meant playing shadow tag to find my next meal</i>

00:47.480 --> 00:50.690
<i>Bit by bit, my heart got bent out of shape</i>

00:50.690 --> 00:53.710
<i>until I tuned out both 
the cheers and the jeers</i>

00:55.910 --> 01:00.580
<i>That's how I survived my initial loneliness</i>

01:00.580 --> 01:05.590
<i>Night falls and the darkness grows</i>

01:06.000 --> 01:10.810
<i>blending in, coalescing</i>

01:11.120 --> 01:15.570
<i>around so trivial a fate as my own</i>

01:15.570 --> 01:18.380
<i>Hey, I want to get through to you</i>

01:18.380 --> 01:22.420
<i>though I may only know commonplace words</i>

01:23.930 --> 01:26.740
<i>It's so frustrating having to be like this</i>

01:26.740 --> 01:29.670
<i>Hey, never mind that it may not be easy</i>

01:29.670 --> 01:34.080
<i>to become angry or let yourself cry</i>

01:35.190 --> 01:38.770
<i>because someone could be listening in</i>

01:38.770 --> 01:41.990
<i>The only thing that's 
certain is the temperature</i>

01:44.250 --> 01:49.170
<i>whether or not we can speak heart to heart</i>

01:52.540 --> 01:57.480
<i>Once, Ouken was adored by all as 
the Sword King of the Underworld.</i>

01:58.700 --> 02:02.590
<i>How is it that he became so villainous?</i>

02:03.940 --> 02:07.940
<i>It all started with some questionable 
research conducted by his father,</i>

02:07.940 --> 02:10.570
<i>Satun, the King of the Underworld.</i>

02:26.800 --> 02:31.020
Almost there... I'm almost there.

02:34.250 --> 02:38.510
<b>Immortality and the Three Brothers</b>

02:38.750 --> 02:42.880
Ah... Ohh!

02:46.290 --> 02:50.110
I've done it! At last, I've done it!

02:53.060 --> 02:54.240
Brother...

03:04.840 --> 03:05.820
I'm not through yet!

03:17.620 --> 03:22.180
He clobbered you but good, didn't he?
 Brother can be such a baby.

03:22.180 --> 03:25.470
No, I asked him to train me.

03:26.590 --> 03:28.430
I'm so weak, after all.

03:29.700 --> 03:32.850
Why am I the only one 
without any superpower?

03:33.430 --> 03:37.320
Superpower or not, you are still strong.

03:37.320 --> 03:41.230
Despa, even you can use some 
superpower, can't you?

03:41.480 --> 03:44.760
My superpower amounts to very little.

03:44.760 --> 03:47.190
I have next to no talent 
when it comes to fighting.

03:47.190 --> 03:49.540
Besides, while he may not look like it,

03:49.540 --> 03:51.950
Brother is fraught with a 
great deal of anguish.

03:52.740 --> 03:54.680
So don't be down on yourself.

03:56.620 --> 03:58.490
Thanks, Despa.

04:06.730 --> 04:07.660
Go.

04:26.670 --> 04:28.830
Almost there.

04:34.620 --> 04:36.200
I can't take this anymore.

04:36.200 --> 04:38.490
Ouken, calm yourself!

04:38.490 --> 04:43.390
Do you have any idea how many 
victims this makes? This isn't...

04:43.390 --> 04:44.470
Rubbish.

04:45.790 --> 04:47.170
Brother...

04:47.170 --> 04:49.170
You can't say that.

04:49.520 --> 04:52.710
Ouken is simply intent 
on saving those people.

04:52.710 --> 04:55.950
And it's that sort of shortsightedness 
that's rubbish.

04:57.070 --> 04:58.900
Let's go, Ouken.

04:59.250 --> 05:01.310
I'm concerned about what's going on in town.

05:07.970 --> 05:09.210
Brother...

05:09.210 --> 05:13.190
I'm going to change this country, 
no matter what it takes.

05:32.550 --> 05:34.850
The odds are against us.

05:36.590 --> 05:38.970
Damn! If this keeps up...

05:45.740 --> 05:47.160
It's Prince Ouken!

05:54.900 --> 05:55.790
Fren!

05:56.360 --> 05:58.500
I've got your back!

05:58.500 --> 05:59.490
Thanks!

06:11.400 --> 06:14.000
These damn Gigantes are formidable.

06:14.000 --> 06:17.490
Prince Ouken, you should withdraw 
and have that wound seen to.

06:18.690 --> 06:20.320
I'll be fine.

06:20.320 --> 06:21.340
Let's go.

06:55.650 --> 06:58.600
Looking at the bigger picture, 
maybe this was unavoidable.

06:58.850 --> 07:02.740
Still, there's no difference whatsoever 
between this and Father's atrocities.

07:02.740 --> 07:05.090
I despise you for this, Brother.

07:05.090 --> 07:06.120
Despa...

07:07.920 --> 07:11.660
Brother, Despa does understand.

07:12.140 --> 07:15.520
The responsibilities borne by those 
at the top are unfathomable.

07:16.030 --> 07:20.380
I'm willing to be your yes-man at any time.

07:28.220 --> 07:31.890
I no longer have the strength to fight back.

07:32.180 --> 07:36.400
Do you still mean to kill me? Your father?

07:36.400 --> 07:38.910
If we don't finish you right here and now,

07:38.910 --> 07:42.720
then you will inevitably recover, 
and bring about hell again.

07:43.110 --> 07:45.650
Oh, Ouken...

07:47.040 --> 07:49.630
Your two older brothers may be botched,

07:49.630 --> 07:51.470
but <i>you</i>, at least...

07:52.490 --> 07:53.950
You disgust me!

07:55.220 --> 07:57.080
The task is mine.

08:02.720 --> 08:03.860
Die!

08:16.300 --> 08:21.310
Ouken! Give me your body!

08:24.090 --> 08:25.160
Ouken!

08:35.440 --> 08:37.170
You drove me out?!

08:45.050 --> 08:50.020
<i>I should have known I didn't stand 
a chance while <i>you</i> still remained!</i>

08:50.020 --> 08:54.020
<i>How disappointing. Utterly disappointing...</i>

08:54.020 --> 08:58.010
<i>I did want your body so badly.</i>

09:02.020 --> 09:07.120
Prince Desha has freed us all 
from the tyranny of Satun.

09:07.120 --> 09:10.240
Prince Desha is the true 
King of the Underworld!

09:10.240 --> 09:12.080
Hooray for King Desha!

09:12.080 --> 09:18.420
Hooray! Hooray! Hooray! Hooray!

09:20.820 --> 09:24.070
There's no difference whatsoever 
between this and Father's atrocities.

09:24.070 --> 09:26.280
I despise you for this, Brother.

09:47.270 --> 09:48.940
Hey there, Despa.

09:48.940 --> 09:51.010
Ouken! And you, too, Fren.

09:51.750 --> 09:53.840
Are you heading out to battle again?

09:53.840 --> 09:56.490
Yes. This trip will be a long one.

09:56.490 --> 10:00.230
We wanted to say goodbye, but you 
never come to the castle anymore.

10:00.600 --> 10:03.210
You'll have to forgive me. 
I haven't the slightest desire

10:03.210 --> 10:06.660
to even look at Brother's face any longer.

10:08.090 --> 10:09.950
Make sure to come back safely, now.

10:10.610 --> 10:13.850
And Fren, you make sure to 
look after Ouken, okay?

10:13.850 --> 10:14.640
Right.

10:32.310 --> 10:35.820
Incredible. Not even a scratch 
even after a battle like that.

10:35.820 --> 10:37.240
That's not true, Fren.

10:41.740 --> 10:42.540
What the...

10:43.080 --> 10:43.940
Watch.

10:46.090 --> 10:47.920
Is that healing magic?

10:48.430 --> 10:50.490
The battle today clinches it.

10:51.000 --> 10:53.340
This is my superpower.

10:53.960 --> 10:56.420
With this power, I can grow...

10:56.420 --> 10:58.160
even stronger.

10:59.710 --> 11:02.710
I hear that Prince Ouken fended 
off the enemy once again.

11:02.710 --> 11:05.100
Yeah, I heard he stood at the forefront,

11:05.100 --> 11:07.100
unafraid of death, and routed the enemy!

11:07.100 --> 11:09.760
He is indeed the Sword King
 of the Underworld.

11:26.270 --> 11:29.750
<i>There is no longer any fear within me.</i>

11:33.770 --> 11:35.220
Prince Ouken!

11:36.100 --> 11:37.510
<i>Just forget...</i>

11:38.870 --> 11:39.830
<i>about the pain.</i>

11:59.040 --> 12:01.280
A-Awesome...

12:05.990 --> 12:11.950
S-Spare me. We are beaten. 
Just spare my life...

12:20.310 --> 12:23.410
Prince Ouken! Please stop! Prince Ouken!

12:23.410 --> 12:24.770
Prince Ouken!

12:31.650 --> 12:34.090
Did <i>I</i>... do that?

12:36.180 --> 12:39.070
Prince Ouken, let's go back to the castle.

12:39.900 --> 12:42.060
I think you could use some rest.

12:48.770 --> 12:50.750
One more push and we will be victorious.

12:51.380 --> 12:54.760
If we retreat now, all of our sacrifices 
will have been for nothing.

13:06.460 --> 13:08.230
All of you, out.

13:11.490 --> 13:14.520
I still have not forgiven you, Brother.

13:15.090 --> 13:17.070
But right now...

13:17.070 --> 13:17.980
What is it?

13:18.480 --> 13:22.150
A letter arrived for me from 
Ouken's second-in-command.

13:25.830 --> 13:29.180
I have a sneaking suspicion that 
this change in Ouken is...

13:32.780 --> 13:33.800
Ouken?

13:36.550 --> 13:38.770
Despa... Brother...

13:39.920 --> 13:40.880
Ouken!

13:40.390 --> 13:41.330
Ouken!

13:54.410 --> 13:58.560
At first, I was delighted 
to have gained this power.

13:58.830 --> 14:01.510
But ever since I got it, I...

14:02.310 --> 14:05.900
Brother, I don't want to lose who I am!

14:06.560 --> 14:07.520
Help me!

14:07.790 --> 14:09.450
Please help me!

14:13.180 --> 14:16.400
I daresay that Ouken has 
become immortal and ageless.

14:17.700 --> 14:22.590
After the fighting ended, I looked over 
every inch of that underground room.

14:22.590 --> 14:27.890
Satun had left his notebook there 
regarding eternal youth and longevity.

14:27.890 --> 14:31.390
Inside, it said that he had finally 
succeeded with the third one.

14:32.080 --> 14:36.400
I see. So that's why, back then, 
he went after Ouken's body.

14:37.930 --> 14:42.000
Apparently, we're going to need the 
head of a demon to lift the curse.

14:42.580 --> 14:45.150
A demon? Where do we find one?

14:45.810 --> 14:47.040
I don't know.

14:47.690 --> 14:49.730
Send out the troops and have them look.

14:50.230 --> 14:53.970
Ouken, it will be all right. 
I'm sure you'll get through this.

14:54.380 --> 14:57.350
No matter what happens, 
we will never forsake you.

14:59.380 --> 15:01.730
Thank you so much.

15:05.380 --> 15:07.510
The captain hasn't been in 
good spirits lately, huh?

15:07.510 --> 15:09.200
I wonder what could have happened to him.

15:09.200 --> 15:12.460
You didn't know? Fren, 
the second-in-command,

15:12.460 --> 15:14.070
has fled from the underworld.

15:14.070 --> 15:15.490
Why would he do that?

15:15.490 --> 15:16.660
Beats me.

15:19.770 --> 15:21.020
Wait up!

15:32.140 --> 15:35.330
<i>Why do living things die?</i>

15:37.450 --> 15:40.480
<i>I need to know... more...</i>

15:41.460 --> 15:42.720
<i>And more...</i>

15:45.430 --> 15:46.490
Sorry about that.

15:49.260 --> 15:52.460
<i>More about when someone dies.</i>

15:59.710 --> 16:01.000
<i>More...</i>

16:07.140 --> 16:08.630
There's a child pinned under there!

16:08.630 --> 16:10.840
Hurry! Hurry and get this off of him!

16:20.750 --> 16:24.700
Oh, Prince Ouken! Prince Ouken has been...

16:24.700 --> 16:26.930
O-Oh, no! Hurry and get a doctor!

16:46.570 --> 16:47.830
What's happening to him?!

16:47.830 --> 16:49.660
Is that really Prince Ouken?

16:49.660 --> 16:50.990
How could it be?!

16:50.990 --> 16:52.000
It's a monster!

16:52.000 --> 16:53.300
It's a monster!

17:04.940 --> 17:06.080
Brother...

17:06.530 --> 17:08.160
I heard the news.

17:09.040 --> 17:10.560
Don't let it get you down.

17:11.330 --> 17:12.940
No, I'm happy.

17:13.950 --> 17:18.890
I was able to take action 
that saved a person's life.

17:20.000 --> 17:23.170
I'm so glad that I still have my soul.

17:23.710 --> 17:24.680
Ouken...

17:25.850 --> 17:29.760
I'm pretty tired. I'm going
 to turn in early.

17:40.330 --> 17:42.250
<i>Ouken...</i>

17:47.080 --> 17:48.460
<i>Ouken...</i>

17:49.820 --> 17:51.160
<i>Ouken...</i>

17:53.690 --> 17:57.400
<i>My dear little Ouken!</i>

18:08.350 --> 18:10.030
<i>Ouken...</i>

18:25.140 --> 18:26.570
Prince Ouken!

18:29.130 --> 18:30.030
Prince Ouken?

18:30.580 --> 18:31.820
What's the matter?

18:35.330 --> 18:37.410
Prince Ouken?

19:10.030 --> 19:11.280
<i>The smell of blood...</i>

19:12.550 --> 19:14.340
<i>I need to know more.</i>

19:16.180 --> 19:18.250
<i>I need to see more...</i>

19:22.590 --> 19:26.760
<i>of that moment when people 
are fighting death.</i>

19:35.420 --> 19:37.240
Wh-Why... are you...?!

19:38.460 --> 19:40.050
Prince Ouken!

19:47.500 --> 19:50.000
It can't be! Ouken?

19:54.240 --> 19:58.390
Brother, you are the only 
one who can stop Ouken.

19:58.390 --> 19:59.300
Of course.

19:59.980 --> 20:02.380
I am the King of the Underworld.

20:29.630 --> 20:32.170
<i>Forgive me, Ouken.</i>

21:20.340 --> 21:32.350
<i>Your precious words are now 
fluttering through the sky</i>

21:35.640 --> 21:41.360
<i>The nights when I was alone 
still had countless stars</i>

21:41.360 --> 21:46.490
<i>Even now, they're close at 
hand whenever I close my eyes</i>

21:46.990 --> 21:49.990
<i>With no destination, I kept on walking</i>

21:49.990 --> 21:52.830
<i>Although I was tired, I kept on walking</i>

21:52.830 --> 21:58.500
<i>I just wanted to remain in prayers forever</i>

21:58.500 --> 22:01.420
<i>Covered in scars, covered in mud</i>

22:01.420 --> 22:04.210
<i>stretching out hands that won't reach</i>

22:04.210 --> 22:14.020
<i>I want to seize a fragment of my 
hopes and dreams right this minute</i>

22:14.430 --> 22:20.190
<i>Keep smiling, keep smiling, 
you don't have to be strong</i>

22:20.190 --> 22:27.610
<i>That sweet smile, that 
sweet smile is all you need</i>

22:27.610 --> 22:32.200
<i>Your unique smile brings 
the power and strength</i>

22:32.200 --> 22:38.670
<i>to chase away all the clouds</i>

22:38.670 --> 22:49.010
<i>Your precious words are now 
fluttering through the sky</i>
